SPEC.md:1413:- [FRONTEND-COST-1] `mylang cost ENTRY.my [FUNCTION] [--json]` reports static Core costs per reachable emitted function and their totals: kept/proved checks, in-place/tested/copied updates, potential dynamic allocation sites, retains/releases, inlining and vector plans. Totals share the `build --stats` counters. LLVM vectorization is unknown without positive optimization remarks; `--llvm-remarks FILE.opt.yaml` reads successful LLVM loop-vectorization remarks separately from Core vector plans. Allocation classification includes runtime scratch, counts unresolved function values and foreign calls conservatively, and is shared with the build-time allocation promise. `--debug`, `--no-facts` and `--verify-facts` select the corresponding build pipeline.
